        "node_id": "n_5_655246",
        "thought_text": "The current approach using bitmask DP is correct in principle, but it doesn't account for the requirement that we can only remove elements from the same half of the array in each snap. This oversight leads to incorrect results for some inputs. To fix this, we need to modify our approach to consider the half-removal constraint while still using a bitmask representation.",
