        "node_id": "n_8_103afa",
        "thought_text": "The error in the current approach is that it doesn't correctly handle the constraint of removing either the first or second half of the array in each step. The dynamic programming solution should consider all possible ways to divide the array and recursively solve for the remaining parts. This approach would correctly handle the Thanos sort constraints and avoid the issue with the previous implementation.",
